  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "現代國際視野",
    "sub_ename": "GLOBAL VISION - STRATEGIC FUTURE THINKING",
    "describe_ch": "此課程教導學生國際上發生的大事，並培養對於未來思辨的能力。氣候變遷、中美貿易戰、西方資本主義對於第三世界的宰制，這些看來似乎遙不可及的事件，實際上卻默默影響了世界上每個人的生活。學生了解這些議題後要培養出以策略性的方式對未來的論述、論辯的能力，成為世界公民。",
    "describe_eh": "This course leads students to learn global events. Some things which are happening in the world, for example, climate change, trade war, capitalism on the third world, might not seem related to us but actually influence our life. Students are expected to cultivate the abilities of critical thinking and dialogues upon the future and thus become global citizens.",
